# Fallen Shinobi comes in by ninjutsu in place of Bot1's unblocked Guerrilla Gorilla and deals 5 combat damage to Bot2.
# Bot2 exiles the top two cards of their library, a Lightning Bolt and an Island, and until end of turn Bot1 may play
# both without paying: the Bolt goes at Bot2 (20 - 5 - 3 = 12) and the Island is played as Bot1's land for the turn.

